    "description": {
        "en_US": "<p>Walls of glass, a long view of the bay, and a hillside garden that turns gold in the late afternoon. This contemporary home was designed around its light: every main room faces east, and the great room opens onto a deck that runs the width of the house.</p><p>Upstairs, four bedrooms include a primary suite with its own terrace. Below, a flexible lower level suits guests, a studio or a home gym. Waterdog Lake's trails begin at the top of the street.</p>",
        "es": "<p>Paredes de vidrio, una amplia vista de la bah\u00eda y un jard\u00edn en la ladera que se vuelve dorado al final de la tarde. Esta casa contempor\u00e1nea se dise\u00f1\u00f3 en torno a su luz: cada espacio principal mira al este, y la sala se abre a una terraza que recorre todo el ancho de la casa.</p><p>Arriba, cuatro habitaciones incluyen una suite principal con terraza propia. Abajo, un nivel flexible sirve para invitados, un estudio o un gimnasio. Los senderos de Waterdog Lake empiezan al final de la calle.</p>"
    },
    "features": {
        "en_US": "Bay views from every main room\nFull-width deck off the great room\nPrimary suite with a private terrace\nFlexible lower level with its own entrance\nSolar panels and an EV charger\nLandscaped hillside garden",
        "es": "Vista a la bah\u00eda desde cada espacio principal\nTerraza a todo lo ancho junto a la sala\nSuite principal con terraza privada\nNivel inferior flexible con entrada propia\nPaneles solares y cargador para auto el\u00e9ctrico\nJard\u00edn en la ladera con paisajismo"
    },
